   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eval migration &amp; asylum</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv migration &amp; asyl</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An evaluation regarding support within the field of migration and asylum will be conducted, basically covering the time period from 1999 until today. Focus will be on the Baltic countries, but discussions as to focus and method regarding support to Russia and Ukraine will also be included</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En utv&#xe4;rdering av st&#xf6;det inom omr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r migration och asyl (Migrationsverket) huvudsakligen t&#xe4;ckande perioden fr&#xe5;n 1999 till idag, skall genomf&#xf6;ras. Fokus ligger p&#xe5; de baltiska l&#xe4;nderna, men &#xe4;ven resonemang avseende metod och inriktning avseende Ryssland och Ukraina ing&#xe5;r.</narrative>
  </description>
